 rosemary, salt, and pepper.","secondary_message":"¾ cup panko bread crumbs\n1 ½ tsp rosemary\n¾ tsp salt\n¾ tsp black pepper"},{"id":64666,"primary_message":"Coat lamb chops with garlic and Dijon mixture on both sides, then place in breadcrumb mixture and coat.","secondary_message":"18 lamb rib chops"},{"id":64669,"primary_message":"Coat bottom of skillet with oil. Add lamb and cook until golden brown and cooked through, 2-3 minutes per side.","secondary_message":"3 tbsp virgin coconut oil"},{"id":64668,"primary_message":"Add remaining garlic and mint, olive oil, salt, and pepper to saucepan with peas; mash until smooth.","secondary_message":"3 tbsp extra virgin olive oil\n⅜ tsp salt\n⅜ tsp black pepper"},{"id":64667,"primary_message":"Serve by placing pea purée on a plate and sprinkle with feta. Add lamb on top and enjoy!","secondary_message":"1 ½ (113 g) pkg crumbled feta cheese"}],"line_items":[{"id":69176,"quantity":"1 ½ (113 g) pkg","ingredient_name":"crumbled feta cheese"},{"id":69171,"quantity":"1 ½ small pkgs","ingredient_name":"fresh mint"},{"id":69175,"quantity":"6 cups","ingredient_name":"frozen peas"},{"id":69174,"quantity":"9 cloves","ingredient_name":"garlic"},{"id":69172,"quantity":"18","ingredient_name":"lamb rib chops"},{"id":69170,"quantity":"","ingredient_name":"black pepper"},{"id":69169,"quantity":"","ingredient_name":"Dijon mustard"},{"id":69173,"quantity":"","ingredient_name":"extra virgin olive oil"},{"id":69168,"quantity":"","ingredient_name":"panko bread crumbs"},{"id":69165,"quantity":"","ingredient_name":"rosemary, dried"},{"id":69167,"quantity":"","ingredient_name":"salt"},{"id":69166,"quantity":"","ingredient_name":"virgin coconut oil"}],"nutrition":{"energy":803.45,"alcohol":0.02,"ash":6.86,"caffeine":0.0,"water":260.3,"carbs":28.33,"fiber":7.67,"starch":12.17,"sugars":8.65,"fructose":0.61,"galactose":0.0,"glucose":0.36,"lactose":1.16,"maltose":0.25,"sucrose":6.27,"sugar_alcohol":0.0,"fat":53.69,"monounsaturated":20.33,"polyunsaturate